{"cursor":29,"event":{"attempt":{"attempt_id":"4b5926eb-09c0-47b4-bb21-908b5829509d","fence":1,"session_id":"4370da08-d4b5-411b-9db5-40c9e9c8868d","worker_id":"de1cae67-4c21-4d90-98ab-67ba5b22b324"},"cursor":29,"event":{"event":{"messages":[{"content":"","role":"system","sections":{"cayw-runtime-codemode":"Use execute_code with action=exec, script, yield_time_ms and max_output_tokens for bounded Luau cells. A timed reply can leave the VM running: use action=wait with its cell_id, next_cursor, yield_time_ms and max_output_tokens until status is terminal and has_more is false. wait resumes yield_control unless continue_execution=false. Use tool_search(query,limit) or ALL_TOOLS to discover names and toolDefinition(name) for needed schemas. Invoke capabilities with cayw.call(name, arguments). Helpers store/load retain versioned session values; text, image, audio and notify produce typed output. return a JSON value or cayw.emit(value). Discovery is not permission. Every exact invocation needs host authorization. Never approve your own request or replay uncertain effects. No ambient shell, network or filesystem APIs are available."},"tools_added":[],"tools_removed":[]},{"content":[{"text":"Reply with exactly CAYW_IPC_REAL_OK and nothing else.","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1794100303886},{"content":"","role":"system","sections":{},"tools_added":[{"description":"Execute or wait for one bounded Luau cell. Arguments are a JSON object. cursor, yield_time_ms and max_output_tokens use JSON integers; exact nonnegative decimal strings (including integral decimal or exponent forms) are converted before the same range checks. Example exec arguments: {\"action\":\"exec\",\"script\":\"return 1 + 1\",\"yield_time_ms\":0,\"max_output_tokens\":1024}. exec creates a globally unique cell_id; wait reads incremental output after cursor without replay. yield_time_ms returns early without cancelling the managed VM. wait resumes yield_control unless continue_execution=false. When the returned page has vm_alive=true or has_more=true, callers must continue invoking action=\"wait\" with the same cell_id and cursor=next_cursor until vm_alive=false and has_more=false; do not replay exec. Helpers inside the Luau script: store(key,value,expected_version), load(key), text(string), image(mime,base64), audio(mime,base64), notify(message,completed,total), exit(code), yield_control(), toolDefinition(name), tool_search(query,limit). store(key,value,expected_version) requires all 3 arguments: expected_version is mandatory; pass 0 for a new key, or the version returned by load(key).version when updating an existing key. load(key) returns an object with version and value, or null if absent. ALL_TOOLS is a read-only array of tool names. toolDefinition and tool_search are Luau functions, not external tool names. Use return or cayw.emit(value) for JSON values, including tables. pcall/xpcall handle ordinary known errors; cancellation, exhausted budgets, unknown effects and exit still stop the cell. Pure computation coroutines and per-cell globals are available. Await host tools from the main script. print, io, os, package, require and math.tointeger are unavailable. Use ordinary Luau operators and bounded string/table/math/utf8 functions. Invoke host tools with cayw.call(name,args); each invocation is authorized. Do not register any other execute_code tool. max_output_tokens is a conservative serialized UTF-8 BYTE budget (minimum 1024), not provider token usage. A page too small for the next item returns required_budget with unchanged cursor. Restart recovers durable records, never a Lua stack. No automatic replay.","name":"execute_code","parameters":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"const":"exec"},"max_output_tokens":{"maximum":131072,"minimum":1024,"type":"integer"},"script":{"maxLength":65536,"type":"string"},"yield_time_ms":{"maximum":30000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["action","script","yield_time_ms","max_output_tokens"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"const":"wait"},"cell_id":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"continue_execution":{"type":"boolean"},"cursor":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"max_output_tokens":{"maximum":131072,"minimum":1024,"type":"integer"},"yield_time_ms":{"maximum":30000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["action","cell_id","cursor","yield_time_ms","max_output_tokens"],"type":"object"}],"type":"object"}}],"tools_removed":[]},{"content":[{"text":"CAYW_IPC_REAL_OK","type":"text"}],"duration_ms":1273,"error_message":null,"model":"auto/deepseek-v4.1-flash","provider":"openai","response_id":"chatcmpl-886954592f0b4e8999988b00fb84a8cd","response_model":"group/auto-deepseek-v4-1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop","timestamp":1794100303894,"usage":{"cache_read":0,"cache_write":0,"input":1229,"output":9,"reasoning":0,"total_tokens":1238},"usage_fields":{"completion_tokens":9,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0},"prompt_tokens":1229,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"total_tokens":1238},"usage_status":"reported"}],"type":"agent_end"},"type":"agent"},"protocol_version":3,"session_id":"4370da08-d4b5-411b-9db5-40c9e9c8868d","timestamp":1794100305183},"session_id":"4370da08-d4b5-411b-9db5-40c9e9c8868d","type":"event"}
